msgid "Properties and expectation values"
msgstr "性质与期望值"

msgid "The property program"
msgstr "性质计算程序"

msgid ""
"The property program allows the evaluation of one-electron operators and "
"expectation values. Normally, the operators are computed automatically when "
"using the global ``GEXPEC`` directive (see section `One-electron operators "
"and expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-"
"operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__) or the ``EXPEC`` or ``TRAN`` "
"commands in the SCF, MCSCF, and CI programs. The explicit use of the "
"property program is only necessary in the rare case that the user is "
"interested in an orbital analysis of the properties."
msgstr ""
"性质计算程序允许评估单电子算符和期望值。通常，在使用全局 ``GEXPEC`` 指令（参见章节 `单电子算符与期望值 (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__\\ ）或 SCF、MCSCF 和 CI 程序中的 ``EXPEC`` 或 ``TRAN`` "
"命令时，算符会自动计算。仅在用户对性质进行轨道分析这种罕见情况下，才需要显式使用性质计算程序。"

msgid "Calling the property program (PROPERTY)"
msgstr "调用性质计算程序 (PROPERTY)"

msgid "``PROPERTY``"
msgstr "``PROPERTY``"

msgid "invokes the property program."
msgstr "调用性质计算程序。"

msgid "Expectation values (DENSITY)"
msgstr "期望值 (DENSITY)"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the density matrix will be read from record  "
"*record.file* and property expectation values will be calculated. If the "
"specification *record.file* is omitted, the last dump record is used. "
"Density matrices for specific states can be selected using *specifications*,"
" as explained in section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__. Note that the density matrices are stored in "
"the same record as the orbitals."
msgstr ""
"如果存在此卡片，将从记录 *record.file* 中读取密度矩阵并计算属性期望值。如果省略了规范 *record.file*\\ "
"，则使用最后一个转储记录。可以使用 *specifications* 选择特定状态的密度矩阵，如章节 `selecting orbitals and "
"density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 所述。请注意，密度矩阵与轨道存储在同一记录中。"

msgid "Orbital analysis (ORBITAL)"
msgstr "轨道分析 (ORBITAL)"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the orbitals are read from record *record.file* and"
" an orbital analysis of the expectation values is printed (the density "
"matrix must also be provided!). If *record.file* is omitted, the last dump "
"record is used. This is only meaningful for diagonal density matrices (SCF "
"or natural orbitals). Natural orbitals for specific states can be selected "
"using *specifications*, as explained in section `selecting orbitals and "
"density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果存在此卡片，将从记录 *record.file* 中读取轨道并打印期望值的轨道分析（也必须提供密度矩阵！）。如果省略了 "
"*record.file*\\ ，则使用最后一个转储记录。这仅对对角密度矩阵（SCF 或自然轨道）有意义。可以使用 *specifications* "
"选择特定状态的自然轨道，如章节 `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 所述。"

msgid "Specification of one-electron operators"
msgstr "单电子算符的指定"

msgid ""
"The required operators are specified by code words. Optionally, the geometry"
" or the nuclear centre at which the operator is computed can be specified."
msgstr "所需的算符由代码字指定。可选地，可以指定计算算符时的几何结构或核中心。"

msgid "For each operator, an input card of the following form is required:"
msgstr "对于每个算符，需要以下形式的输入卡片："

msgid "*code,centre,x,y,z,,factor*"
msgstr "*code,centre,x,y,z,,factor*"

msgid ""
"*code* specifies the property. The available operators are given in section "
"`One-electron operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__."
msgstr ""
"*code* 指定要计算的属性。可用的算符在 `单电子算符和期望值 (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-"
"electron-operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ 一节中给出。"

msgid "The other parameters have the following meaning:"
msgstr "其他参数的含义如下："

msgid "Printing options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid "This card is used to control output, mainly for debugging purposes."
msgstr "此卡片用于控制输出，主要用于调试目的。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following example computes the dipole quadrupole moments of water and "
"prints an orbital analysis. By default, the origin is at the centre of mass,"
" and this is taken as origin for the quadrupole moments."
msgstr "以下示例计算水的偶极四极矩并打印轨道分析。默认情况下，原点位于质心，并以此作为四极矩的原点。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the dipole and quadrupole moments can be computed directly in"
" the SCF and MCSCF programs, but in this case no orbital contributions are "
"printed:"
msgstr "或者，偶极矩和四极矩可以直接在 SCF 和 MCSCF 程序中计算，但在此情况下不会打印轨道贡献："

msgid ""
"There is a another example described in the `Program Control "
"<program_control.html#example-for-computing-expectation-values>`__ section, "
"as well as:"
msgstr ""
"在 `程序控制 <program_control.html#exampleforcomputingexpectationvalues>`__ "
"章节中描述了另一个示例，以及："

msgid "Distributed multipole analysis"
msgstr "分布多极分析"

msgid ""
"Any density matrix can be analysed using the distributed multipole analysis "
"described by Stone, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(81)85452-8>`__ **83**, 233 (1981). The"
" multipole moments arising from the overlap of each pair of primitives are "
"calculated with respect to the overlap centre, and then shifted to the "
"nearest of a number of  *multipole sites*. By default these comprise all "
"atoms specified in the integral input. However the list of multipole sites "
"can be modified by deleting and/or adding sites, and also by restricting the"
" rank of multipole which may be transferred to any given site. The atomic "
"charges are stored in the ``MOLPRO`` variable ``ATCHARGE``. The i’th element"
" in ``ATCHARGE`` corresponds to the i’th row of the Z-matrix input."
msgstr ""
"任何密度矩阵都可以使用 Stone 描述的分布多极分析进行分析，\\ `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(81)85452-8>`__ **83**, 233 "
"(1981)。由每对基元重叠产生的多极矩相对于重叠中心计算，然后转移到最近的多个\\ *多极位点*\\ "
"之一。默认情况下，这些位点包括积分输入中指定的所有原子。但是，可以通过删除和/或添加位点，以及通过限制可以转移到任何给定位点的多极秩来修改多极位点列表。原子电荷存储在"
" ``MOLPRO`` 变量 ``ATCHARGE`` 中。\\ ``ATCHARGE`` 中的第 i 个元素对应于 Z-矩阵输入的第 i 行。"

msgid ""
"Options may appear in any order, except ``DENSITY``, which must be first if "
"given."
msgstr "选项可以按任意顺序出现，但 ``DENSITY`` 除外，如果给出则必须排在首位。"

msgid "The present version does not allow generally contracted AO basis sets."
msgstr "当前版本不允许使用广义收缩的原子轨道基组。"

msgid "Calling the DMA program (DMA)"
msgstr "调用 DMA 程序 (DMA)"

msgid "``DMA;``"
msgstr "``DMA;``"

msgid "This command initializes the DMA program."
msgstr "此命令初始化 DMA 程序。"

msgid "Specifying the density matrix (DENSITY)"
msgstr "指定密度矩阵 (DENSITY)"

msgid ""
"The density matrix to be analysed is that found in record *record* on file "
"*file*. If omitted, *record.file* defaults to current orbital record. If "
"specified, ``DENSITY`` must appear first in the input. Density matrices for "
"specific states can be selected using *specifications*, as explained in "
"section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"待分析的密度矩阵位于文件 *file* 的记录 *record* 中。如果省略，\\ *record.file* 默认为当前轨道记录。如果指定，\\ "
"``DENSITY`` 必须在输入中首先出现。可以使用 *specifications* 选择特定状态的密度矩阵，如章节 `selecting "
"orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 中所述。"

msgid "Linear molecules (LINEAR, GENERAL)"
msgstr "线性分子（LINEAR, GENERAL）"

msgid "(default) invokes the normal program, which copes with any geometry."
msgstr "（默认）调用常规程序，可处理任意几何结构。"

msgid "``LINEAR``"
msgstr "``LINEAR``"

msgid ""
"invokes a faster program which can be used when all the atoms are arranged "
"parallel to the :math:`z`-axis and only the :math:`m=0` components of the "
"multipoles are required."
msgstr "调用一个更快的程序，当所有原子都平行于 :math:`z` 轴排列且仅需要多极矩的 :math:`m=0` 分量时可以使用。"

msgid "Maximum rank of multipoles (LIMIT)"
msgstr "多极矩的最大阶数（LIMIT）"

msgid ""
"*lmax* is the highest rank of multipole that is to be calculated by the "
"program. Default (and maximum) is 10 for the general program and 20 for the "
"linear one. If *name* is specified, the limit applies only to multipole site"
" *name*."
msgstr ""
"*lmax* 是程序要计算的多极矩的最高阶数。默认值（也是最大值）对于通用程序是 10，对于线性程序是 20。如果指定了 *name*\\ "
"，则该限制仅适用于多极矩位点 *name*\\ 。"

msgid "Omitting nuclear contributions (NONUCLEAR)"
msgstr "忽略核贡献 (NONUCLEAR)"

msgid "``NONUCLEAR``"
msgstr "``NONUCLEAR``"

msgid "The nuclear contributions to properties are not to be evaluated."
msgstr "性质计算中不评估核贡献。"

msgid "Specification of multipole sites (ADD, DELETE)"
msgstr "指定多极子位点 (ADD, DELETE)"

msgid ""
"Add a new site at (:math:`x`, :math:`y`, :math:`z`) with the *name* "
"specified. The multipole rank is limited to *lmax* if a value is specified, "
"otherwise the value of lmax specified by the ``LIMIT`` directive is used. No"
" account is taken of symmetry; every site in a symmetry-equivalent set must "
"be specified explicitly. The *radius* of the site may also be specified "
"(default 1.0)."
msgstr ""
"在 (:math:`x`, :math:`y`, :math:`z`) 处添加一个具有指定 *name* 的新位点。如果指定了值，则多极子阶数限制为 "
"*lmax*\\ ，否则使用 ``LIMIT`` 指令指定的 lmax 值。不考虑对称性；对称等价集合中的每个位点都必须明确指定。也可以指定位点的 "
"*radius*\\ （默认值为 1.0）。"

msgid ""
"Delete all atoms with the *name* given from consideration as a multipole "
"site. Note that original atoms from the integral program have names "
":math:`1,2,3,\\ldots` as printed in integral output. ``DELETE,ALL`` deletes "
"all atoms and gives the multipoles with respect to the origin only."
msgstr ""
"从作为多极子位点的考虑中删除所有具有给定 *name* 的原子。请注意，来自积分程序的原始原子具有名称 :math:`1,2,3,\\ldots`\\ "
"，如积分输出中所打印。\\ ``DELETE,ALL`` 删除所有原子，并仅给出相对于原点的多极子。"

msgid "Defining the radius of multipole sites (RADIUS)"
msgstr "定义多极位点的半径（RADIUS）"

msgid ""
"Assign radius :math:`r` to all sites with the *name* given. The program "
"moves multipoles at an overlap centre :math:`P` to the site :math:`S` for "
"which the value of :math:`|P-S|/r(S)` is smallest. In the absence of a "
"``RADIUS`` directive, all sites are given radius 1."
msgstr ""
"为所有具有给定\\ *名称*\\ 的位点分配半径 :math:`r`\\ 。程序将重叠中心 :math:`P` 处的多极矩移动到使 "
":math:`|P-S|/r(S)` 值最小的位点 :math:`S`\\ 。在没有 ``RADIUS`` 指令的情况下，所有位点的半径均设为 1。"

msgid "Notes and references"
msgstr "注释与参考文献"

msgid ""
"The multipoles produced by this analysis are given in their spherical "
"harmonic definitions. Explicit formulae for translating between the "
"cartesian and spherical harmonic definitions of the multipole moments are "
"given in, *Explicit formulae for the electrostatic energy, forces and "
"torques between a pair of molecules of arbitrary symmetry*, S. L. Price, A. "
"J. Stone, and M. Alderton, Molec. Phys., 52, 987 (1984)."
msgstr ""
"此分析产生的多极矩以其球谐函数定义给出。关于笛卡尔坐标与球谐函数定义之间多极矩转换的显式公式，请参见：\\ *Explicit formulae for"
" the electrostatic energy, forces and torques between a pair of molecules of"
" arbitrary symmetry*, S. L. Price, A. J. Stone, and M. Alderton, Molec. "
"Phys., 52, 987 (1984)。"

msgid ""
"For examples of the use of ``DMA`` analysis see, Price and Stone, `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(83)80079-7>`__ **98**, 419"
" (1983); Buckingham and Fowler, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.445721>`__ **79**, 6426 (1983)."
msgstr ""
"关于 ``DMA`` 分析的使用示例，请参见：Price and Stone, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(83)80079-7>`__ **98**, 419 (1983); "
"Buckingham and Fowler, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.445721>`__ **79**, 6426 (1983)。"

msgid "The following input calculates SCF multipole moments for water."
msgstr "以下输入计算水的 SCF 多极矩。"

msgid "Mulliken population analysis"
msgstr "Mulliken 布居分析"

msgid "Calling the population analysis program (POP)"
msgstr "调用布居分析程序 (POP)"

msgid ""
"Invokes Mulliken analysis program, which analyses any density matrix into "
"its contributions from s,p,d,f... basis functions on each atom. In the case "
"of Hartree-Fock, density functional, and MCSCF calculations, the density "
"matrix is taken from the last dump record, unless overridden with the "
"``DENSITY`` card. For other methods, the density matrix has to be written "
"and then must be referred to with the ``DENSITY`` card."
msgstr ""
"调用Mulliken分析程序，该程序将任意密度矩阵分析为每个原子上s、p、d、f…基函数的贡献。对于Hartree-"
"Fock、密度泛函和MCSCF计算，密度矩阵取自最后的转储记录，除非被\\ ``DENSITY``\\ "
"卡片覆盖。对于其他方法，密度矩阵必须先写出，然后必须通过\\ ``DENSITY``\\ 卡片引用。"

msgid ""
"The subcommands may be abbreviated by the first four characters. The atomic "
"charges are stored in the ``MOLPRO`` variable ``ATCHARGE``. The i’th element"
" in ``ATCHARGE`` corresponds to the i’th row of the Z-matrix input."
msgstr ""
"子命令可以缩写为前四个字符。原子电荷存储在\\ ``MOLPRO``\\ 变量\\ ``ATCHARGE``\\ 中。\\ ``ATCHARGE``\\"
" 中的第i个元素对应于Z-矩阵输入的第i行。"

msgid "Defining the density matrix (DENSITY)"
msgstr "定义密度矩阵 (DENSITY)"

msgid ""
"Take density matrix to be analysed from record *record* on file *file*. "
"Density matrices for specific states can be selected using *specifications*,"
" as explained in section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__. Note that the density matrices are stored in "
"the same record as the orbitals."
msgstr ""
"从文件\\ *file*\\ 的记录\\ *record*\\ 中获取待分析的密度矩阵。可以使用\\ *规范*\\ 选择特定状态的密度矩阵，如章节\\ "
"`选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-"
"orbitals-and-density-matrices-orbital-density>`__\\ 中所述。请注意，密度矩阵与轨道存储在同一记录中。"

msgid "Populations of basis functions (INDIVIDUAL)"
msgstr "基函数的布居 (INDIVIDUAL)"

msgid ""
"If specified, the Mulliken populations of each individual basis function are"
" printed."
msgstr "若指定，则打印每个单独基函数的 Mulliken 布居。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows how to compute the population first on the "
"Hartree-Fock level, and then on the CI level."
msgstr "以下示例展示了如何先在 Hartree-Fock 级别计算布居，然后在 CI 级别计算。"

msgid ""
"In the following example, the population for charge and spin is computed:"
msgstr "在以下示例中，计算了电荷和自旋的布居："

msgid "Natural Bond Orbital Analysis"
msgstr "自然键轨道分析"

msgid "Calling the Natural Bond Orbital analysis program (NBO)"
msgstr "调用自然键轨道分析程序 (NBO)"

msgid ""
"One can choose to truncate the transformation series (e.g., only compute the"
" NAO orbitals), with help of the ``LEVEL`` keyword. If *level*\\ =1, only "
"the NAO transformation will be carried out. For *level*\\ =2 the NBO "
"transformation is performed, and for 3 the NLMO (default)."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``LEVEL`` 关键字选择截断变换序列（例如，仅计算 NAO 轨道）。如果 *level*\\ =1，则仅执行 NAO 变换。对于 "
"*level*\\ =2，执行 NBO 变换，对于 3 则执行 NLMO 变换（默认）。"

msgid ""
"Sometimes, the NBO procedure will not converge due to a bad ordering on the "
"2-center bond search. The first run is based on the Wiberg bond index, but "
"the algorithm switches to the atom ordering on the subsequent runs. This can"
" be avoided by the use of the option ``KEEP_WBI``. If *wbi_option*\\ =1, the"
" Wiberg bond index is used in all iterations."
msgstr ""
"有时，由于二中心键搜索的排序不佳，NBO 过程可能无法收敛。首次运行基于 Wiberg 键级指数，但算法在后续运行中会切换到原子排序。这可以通过使用选项"
" ``KEEP_WBI`` 来避免。如果 *wbi_option*\\ =1，则在所有迭代中都使用 Wiberg 键级指数。"

msgid "Saving the NLMO orbitals (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存 NLMO 轨道 (SAVE)"

msgid ""
"The NLMO orbitals are saved in the specified *record*, together with the NPA"
" charges."
msgstr "NLMO 轨道与 NPA 电荷一同保存在指定的 *record* 中。"

msgid "Finite field calculations"
msgstr "有限场计算"

msgid ""
"Dipole moments, quadrupole moments etc. and the corresponding "
"polarizabilities can be obtained as energy derivatives by the finite "
"difference approximation. This is most easily done with the ``DIP``, "
"``QUAD``, or ``FIELD`` commands, which add a specified amount of the dipole,"
" quadrupole, or any general, operators to the Hamiltonian. An error will "
"result if the added perturbation is not totally symmetric (symmetry 1). Note"
" that the orbitals must be recomputed before performing a correlation "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"偶极矩、四极矩等及其相应的极化率可以通过有限差分近似作为能量导数获得。这最容易通过 ``DIP``\\ 、\\ ``QUAD`` 或 ``FIELD``"
" 命令完成，这些命令将指定量的偶极、四极或任何通用算符添加到哈密顿量中。如果添加的微扰不是完全对称的（对称性 "
"1），将会导致错误。请注意，在执行相关计算之前，必须重新计算轨道。"

msgid "Dipole fields (DIP)"
msgstr "偶极场 (DIP)"

msgid ""
"Add a finite combination of the dipole operators :math:`\\vec\\mu=(\\mu_x, "
"\\mu_y, \\mu_z)`, :math:`H_1=\\vec d \\cdot \\vec \\mu` ( :math:`\\vec "
"d=(\\textit{dx},\\textit{dy},\\textit{dz})`)  to the Hamiltonian (both the "
"1-electron operator and the core energy). ``DIP+`` adds to any existing "
"field, otherwise any previous perturbation is removed."
msgstr ""
"向哈密顿量（包括单电子算符和核心能量）中添加偶极算符 :math:`\\vec\\mu=(\\mu_x, \\mu_y, \\mu_z)` 的有限组合 "
":math:`H_1=\\vec d \\cdot \\vec \\mu`\\ （其中 :math:`\\vec "
"d=(\\textit{dx},\\textit{dy},\\textit{dz})`\\ ）。\\ ``DIP+`` "
"会累加到任何现有场上，否则将移除先前的微扰。"

msgid ""
"The perturbed hamiltonian represents a physical system in a uniform electric"
" field with electric field strength :math:`\\vec F= -\\vec d`. Therefore the"
" corresponding energy-derivative form of the dipole moment projection in "
"this direction can be obtained as"
msgstr ""
"微扰后的哈密顿量表示处于均匀电场中的物理系统，其电场强度为 :math:`\\vec F= -\\vec d`\\ "
"。因此，该方向上的偶极矩投影对应的能量导数形式可表示为"

msgid ""
"|\\vec F|^{-1}\\vec F \\cdot \\vec \\mu  = |2\\vec d|^{-1}(E(\\vec "
"d)-E(-\\vec d)) + O(|\\vec d|^2)= |\\vec d|^{-1}(E(\\vec d)-E(\\vec 0)) + "
"O(|\\vec d|)."
msgstr ""
"|\\vec F|^{-1}\\vec F \\cdot \\vec \\mu  = |2\\vec d|^{-1}(E(\\vec d)-E(-\\vec d)) + O(|\\vec d|^2)= |\\vec d|^{-1}(E(\\vec d)-E(\\vec 0)) + O(|\\vec d|).\n"
"\n"

msgid "Quadrupole fields (QUAD)"
msgstr "四极矩场 (QUAD)"

msgid ""
"Exactly as the ``DIP`` command, but adds a combination of quadrupole "
"operators to the Hamiltonian."
msgstr "与 ``DIP`` 命令完全相同，但向哈密顿量中添加一组四极矩算符的组合。"

msgid "General fields (FIELD)"
msgstr "通用场 (FIELD)"

msgid ""
"Adds one-electron operators *oper1*, *oper2*, …with the corresponding "
"factors *fac1*, *fac2*, …to the one-electron hamiltonian. The available "
"operators are given in section `One-electron operators and expectation "
"values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-"
"expectation-values-gexpec>`__. An error will result if the added "
"perturbation is not totally symmetric (symmetry 1)."
msgstr ""
"将单电子算符 *oper1*\\ 、\\ *oper2*\\ 、… 及其对应的系数 *fac1*\\ 、\\ *fac2*\\ 、… "
"添加到单电子哈密顿量中。可用的算符列于 `单电子算符与期望值 (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-"
"operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ 一节。如果添加的微扰不是完全对称的（对称性 1），将导致错误。"

msgid ""
"``FIELD+`` adds to any existing field, otherwise any previous field is "
"removed."
msgstr "``FIELD+`` 会添加到任何现有场中，否则任何先前的场将被移除。"

msgid ""
"Note that ``FIELD`` does currently not modify core polarization potentials "
"(CPP). If CPPs are present, only ``DIP`` and ``QUAD`` should be used."
msgstr "请注意，\\ ``FIELD`` 目前不修改核极化势 (CPP)。如果存在 CPP，应仅使用 ``DIP`` 和 ``QUAD``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The first examples shows various possibilities to add perturbations to the "
"one-electron hamiltonian."
msgstr "第一个示例展示了向单电子哈密顿量添加微扰的各种可能性。"

msgid ""
"The second example shows how to compute dipole moments and polarizabilities "
"using finite fields."
msgstr "第二个示例展示了如何使用有限场计算偶极矩和极化率。"

msgid ""
"Derivatives with respect to fields (dipole, quadrupole, second and third "
"moments)"
msgstr "关于场的导数（偶极矩、四极矩、二阶矩和三阶矩）"

msgid ""
"Derivatives with respect to fields can be computed with the keywords "
"``FGRAD`` (1st derivative) and ``FPOL`` (2nd derivative). The fields may be "
"dipole (``DM``), quadrupole (``QM``), second (``SM``) and third (``TM``) "
"moments, and also their individual components (e.g. ``DMX``, ``XZ``, "
"``QMXY``, ``XXX``)."
msgstr ""
"关于场的导数可以使用关键字 ``FGRAD``\\ （一阶导数）和 ``FPOL``\\ （二阶导数）计算。场可以是偶极矩（\\ ``DM``\\ "
"）、四极矩（\\ ``QM``\\ ）、二阶矩（\\ ``SM``\\ ）和三阶矩（\\ ``TM``\\ ），也可以是它们的分量（例如 "
"``DMX``\\ 、\\ ``XZ``\\ 、\\ ``QMXY``\\ 、\\ ``XXX``\\ ）。"

msgid "Second derivatives include a minus sign, e.g."
msgstr "二阶导数包含一个负号，例如"

msgid "-\\frac{\\partial^2 E}{\\partial d_i \\partial d_j}"
msgstr ""
"-\\frac{\\partial^2 E}{\\partial d_i \\partial d_j}\n"
"\n"

msgid "where :math:`d_i` are the components of the dipole field."
msgstr "\\ 其中 :math:`d_i` 是偶极场的分量。"

msgid ""
"The syntax for the first or second derivative with respect to a dipole field"
" is like this:"
msgstr "关于偶极场的一阶或二阶导数的语法如下："

msgid "``FGRAD,OPER=DM,PROC=myproc`` or ``FPOL,OPER=DM,PROC=myproc``"
msgstr "``FGRAD,OPER=DM,PROC=myproc`` 或 ``FPOL,OPER=DM,PROC=myproc``"

msgid "where ``myproc`` has to be defined."
msgstr "其中 ``myproc`` 必须被定义。"

msgid ""
"By default a two-point formula is used for first derivatives (keyword "
"``CENTRAL``). Alternatively, a forward-difference formula ``FORWARD`` (fast,"
" but inaccurate) or a fourpoint formula may be used ``FOURPOINT`` ."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，一阶导数使用两点公式（关键词 ``CENTRAL``\\ ）。或者，可以使用前向差分公式 ``FORWARD``\\ "
"（快速但不精确）或四点公式 ``FOURPOINT``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The default step size is 0.001 a.u. and may be changed with the option "
"``STRENGTH``."
msgstr "默认步长为 0.001 a.u.，可以通过选项 ``STRENGTH`` 更改。"

msgid ""
"The quadrupole tensor is traceless which is exploited by default in the case"
" of first derivatives. It may be switched off with ``ZERO_TRACE_UNUSED``"
msgstr "四极矩张量是无迹的，在一阶导数的情况下默认利用此特性。可以通过 ``ZERO_TRACE_UNUSED`` 关闭此功能。"

msgid ""
"The energy calculation has to be done with a ``PROCEDURE`` (alternatively, "
"``STARTCMD`` may also be used)."
msgstr "能量计算必须通过 ``PROCEDURE`` 完成（或者，也可以使用 ``STARTCMD``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"This example shows how dipole, quadrupole and third moments can be obtained "
"by computing derivatives with respect to the corresponding fields, and the "
"dipole polarizability."
msgstr "此示例展示了如何通过计算相对于相应场的导数来获得偶极矩、四极矩和三阶矩，以及偶极极化率。"

msgid "Relativistic corrections"
msgstr "相对论校正"

msgid ""
"Relativistic corrections may be calculated within the Cowan-Griffin approach"
" by computing expectation values of the mass-velocity and 1-electron Darwin "
"integrals; these should be generated using the property integral program "
"with keyword ``REL`` The expectation values can be computed within the SCF, "
"MCSCF and CI programs in the usual way using the ``EXPEC`` command, again "
"with the keyword ``REL``. The mass-velocity and Darwin terms, and their sum "
"are subsequently available through the Molpro variables ``MASSV``, "
"``DARWIN`` and ``EREL`` respectively. An example can be found `here "
"<program_control.html#example-for-computing-relativistic-corrections>`__."
msgstr ""
"相对论校正可以通过 Cowan-Griffin 方法计算，即计算质量-速度和单电子达尔文积分的期望值；这些应使用属性积分程序并配合关键字 ``REL``"
" 来生成。期望值可以在 SCF、MCSCF 和 CI 程序中通过常规方式使用 ``EXPEC`` 命令计算，同样需配合关键字 ``REL``\\ "
"。质量-速度项、达尔文项及其总和随后可通过 Molpro 变量 ``MASSV``\\ 、\\ ``DARWIN`` 和 ``EREL`` "
"分别获取。示例可在此处找到 `here "
"<program_control.html#exampleforcomputingrelativisticcorrections>`__\\ 。"

msgid "``DENSITY [,record.file] [,specifications]``"
msgstr "``DENSITY [,record.file] [,specifications]``"

msgid "``ORBITAL [,record.file]  [,specifications]``"
msgstr "``ORBITAL [,record.file]  [,specifications]``"

msgid ""
"***centre*** row number of Z–matrix or atomic symbol defining the centre at "
"which property shall be calculated; if  *centre*\\ :math:`\\ne 0` you need "
"not read in coordinates."
msgstr ""
"***centre*** Z–矩阵的行号或原子符号，用于定义计算性质的中心；若 *\\ centre*\\ :math:`\\ne 0`\\ "
"，则无需读入坐标。"

msgid "***x,y,z*** cartesian coordinates of the point (only if *centre*\\ =0)."
msgstr "***x,y,z*** 该点的笛卡尔坐标（仅当 *\\ centre*\\ =0 时使用）。"

msgid ""
"***factor*** the operator is multiplied by this factor. The default is "
"*factor*\\ =1 except for ``REL``. In this cases proper factors for "
"relativistic corrections are used unless *factor* is given. The two commas "
"before factor are needed to preserve compatibility with ``Molpro96``."
msgstr ""
"***factor*** 算符将乘以该因子。默认值为 *\\ factor\\ *\\ =1，``REL`` 除外。在后一种情况下，除非给定 *\\ "
"factor*，否则使用相对论校正的适当因子。factor 前的两个逗号是为了保持与 ``Molpro96`` 的兼容性而必需的。"

msgid "``PRINT,print``"
msgstr "``PRINT,print``"

msgid "***print*\\ :math:`= 0`** no test output (default)"
msgstr "***print*\\ :math:`= 0`** 不输出测试信息（默认）"

msgid "***print*\\ :math:`> 0`** operators are printed."
msgstr "***print*\\ :math:`> 0`** 打印算符。"

