msgid "``NBO,[WITH_CORE=core_option],[LEVEL=level],[KEEP_WBI=wbi_option];``"
msgstr "``NBO,[WITH_CORE=core_option],[LEVEL=level],[KEEP_WBI=wbi_option];``"

msgid ""
"The Natural Bond Orbital Analysis of Weinhold and coworkers (`J. Chem. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.449486>`__ **83**, 735 (1985), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.449360>`__ **83**, 1736 (1985) and J. "
"Chem. Phys. 78 (1983) 4066) can be called by the use of the ``NBO`` card. It"
" reads from a density or orbital record, and performs the necessary "
"transformations to Natural Atomic Orbitals (NAO), Natural Bond Orbitals "
"(NBO) and Natural Localized Molecular Orbitals (NLMO). The latter can also "
"be saved to a record and later used in local correlation treatments (cf. "
"Section :doc:`PAO-based local correlation treatments <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments>`). By default, the full orbital space is"
" used. The core orbitals can, however, be left out of the procedure if "
"*core_option*\\ =0."
msgstr ""
"Weinhold 及其合作者的自然键轨道分析（\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.449486>`__ **83**, 735 (1985)，\\ `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.449360>`__ **83**, 1736 (1985) 以及 J. "
"Chem. Phys. 78 (1983) 4066）可通过 ``NBO`` "
"卡片调用。它从密度或轨道记录中读取数据，并执行必要的变换以得到自然原子轨道（NAO）、自然键轨道（NBO）和自然局域分子轨道（NLMO）。后者也可保存到记录中，以供后续局域相关处理使用（参见"
" :doc:`基于 PAO 的局域相关处理 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>` "
"一节）。默认使用完整轨道空间。不过，若 *core_option*\\ =0，则可将芯轨道排除在该过程之外。"

msgid "``SAVE,record.file;``"
msgstr "``SAVE,record.file;``"

